      "review_by": "2026-12-05",
      "reason": "Source inspection: JSON-only @RestController; no XsltView, XsltViewResolver, stylesheet resource, MVC view resolver or template configuration. The vulnerable XSLT view path is not used. This assessment must be revisited before enabling MVC views.",
